- `/group` - followed by the message text, sends a message to the private group currently joined.

To create a group, clients can use `/create` followed by the group name, e.g., `/create mygroup` to create a private group named "mygroup". Clients can join the group using the `/join` command. To send a message to the group, clients can use the `/group` command followed by the message text.

